class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>当前方向：{</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">placement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()}&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"提示内容\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Tooltip</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">`按 ${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">placement</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">()</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">} 方向显示的一段说明文案`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">placement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">placement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>悬停或聚焦这里&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Tooltip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"
